# Untitled

RiceFOX: A Database of Arabidopsis Mutant Lines Overexpressing Rice Full-Length cDNA that Contains a Wide Range of Trait Information to Facilitate Analysis of Gene Function
Tetsuya Sakurai\(^{1,\ast}\), Youichi Kondou\(^{1,5}\), Kenji Akiyama\(^{1}\), Atsushi Kurotani\(^{1}\), Mieko Higuchi\(^{1}\), Takanari Ichikawa\(^{1,6}\), Hirofumi Kuroda\(^{1,7}\), Miyako Kusano\(^{1}\), Masaki Mori\(^{2}\), Tsutomu Saitou\(^{3,8}\), Hitoshi Sakakibara\(^{1}\), Shoji Sugano\(^{2}\), Makoto Suzuki\(^{1,9}\), Hideki Takahashi\(^{1,9}\), Shinya Takahashi\(^{1,10}\), Hiroshi Takatsuji\(^{2}\), Naoki Yokotani\(^{3,11}\), Takeshi Yoshizumi\(^{1}\), Kazuki Saito\(^{1,4}\), Kazuo Shinozaki\(^{1}\), Kenji Oda\(^{3}\), Hirohiko Hirochika\(^{2}\) and Minami Matsui\(^{1}\)
